{"schemaVersion":"galpedia-static-detail-model-v1","dataRevision":"a0c0367b8270b080feef0ef1fe65522144dc62343feb9d752729d92867d0d639","workId":"28928","model":{"presentationWorkId":"vndb:v26723","staff":{"artwork":[{"creditedName":"こやまいち","creatorId":"vndb:s19239","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:34955","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s19239","name":"こやまいち","roleCode":"artwork","roleLabel":"原画","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:214370","source":"egs"}],"scenario":[{"creditedName":"フレーム","creatorId":"vndb:s621","sourcePersonId":"egs:creator:1565","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s621","name":"フレーム","roleCode":"scenario","roleLabel":"剧本","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-creator:214371","source":"egs"}],"music":[],"other":[]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c87007","characterName":"ソフィア・グリュー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c87007"},"originalCharacterName":"ソフィア・グリュー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Queen of the current King. She is a refined lady full of motherly affection who treats everyone equally regardless of her position. She loves her husband a lot but is troubled about not being able to bear his successor. As a result, she has no choice but to accept it when the King welcomes a new concubine to his side. However, she still feels hurt and regret deep inside when her beloved husband embraces another woman."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87007"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cf/cf6c585abb51e1d24029791489a4050e24aa41d915d42c674b2a35d027449157.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fad52cca5e1abf71b961072cf6afb29e6ae3b9cdb02df76120e8f86dc2a31710.webp","width":157,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長原 杏子","creatorId":"vndb:s1450","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1450","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1450","name":"雨宮 侑布","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:82821","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c87008","characterName":"ルーベンス・グリュー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c87008"},"originalCharacterName":"ルーベンス・グリュー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The current King who is respected by everyone for his generosity and admirable character. He loves his wife Sofia very much but due to the pressure from surrounding about not having a successor even after 15 years of marriage, he unwillingly accepts a new concubine while holding guilty feeling for his beloved wife."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87008"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/24/247e43b26897deb56f0beb43ee80a97552bca624cdec59fcecd0c74db6524558.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cd/cd3aed623e2b217a2967f63e1498271a1e82dd56bfecdb94b7ae052d73f9fbc6.webp","width":174,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c87009","characterName":"リック・グレーバー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c87009"},"originalCharacterName":"リック・グレーバー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Former Knight before his country lost the war and was subjugated by another. Becoming prisoner of war and disowned by family, he loses everything and is at a loss to know what his life will become from now on. That's when he meets Tanya, the maid who served his family long time ago. She informs him that he is actually descendant of the former King. As if it's not shocking enough, now he has duty to impregnate the Queen in secret in order to keep his ancestor's bloodline enthroned instead of the current King's."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87009"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e22b9a09be4128d8918148e3ce33c58953bf797060c7f2d9919a5ebd5148bda1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7a37eba0fd4a69e1cac2e58ad07ddb4f1ce3d4eff74e7e2c4baf84e1fc20d9ae.webp","width":162,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c87010","characterName":"ターニャ・スターク","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c87010"},"originalCharacterName":"ターニャ・スターク","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Personal maid of Queen Sofia and former maid of the protagonist's family long time ago. She appears in front of the protagonist again to inform him about the truth of his origin and give him the duty to impregnate the Queen as it's the will of the former King to preserve his bloodline. She is also the protagonist's first love."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c87010"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/77d7c373b9a14de9d45592e3bb7f54078e6a26dfedee3aab5e2f24cecc12adae.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fdee416aa2c9f9a3af41e9ef6891250f2c038